    <item>
      <title>Jean 0.4.1</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:52:10 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>145</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>&lt;h3&gt;Jean 0.4.1&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**Tidier Slack threads** - Send several messages in a row and Jean answers them together, once. - A "thanks" or "all good" gets a 👍 instead of a reply. - Each request ends as one message: the "On it" card turns into the answer. - Shorter answers, no repeated commands, and a new topic gets its own thread.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**Studio message queue** - Type while Studio is working: your message joins the task in progress. - If the task has just finished, it waits and runs next. Stop hands it back.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/msiegerJBI/jean-updates/releases/download/v0.4.1/Jean.dmg" length="140265493" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Qt31XMatk+J1H8BTQx3abz0FuhdHXY9mzy3hm1oogLE/W+lm/Y7mtD4CK7XZitPxUenGMAUh69AxmFt8Pm+ZDA==" />
    </item>
